[06:14] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'sorts of stuff like that. Um, if you have chosen a hex grid, you can even enable numbering for the different hex\'s and change the opacity of the numbers and uh how the grid should look like and so on. You can really configure this to'

