VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'your liking. Um, let\'s go back to this though and disable it on both uh the DM view and the player view. Um, because we don\'t need it right now. You can also, which I think is pretty cool, you can'

[06:41] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'freeze the player camera like this. By the way, I\'m opening this by hitting the space key. You can then search with the keyboard for options. You can use tab to switch between tabs. Um, and then I could, for example, go ahead'

[06:55] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
